Design a Banking System using Java Abstract Classes and Inheritance.

A bank has multiple types of accounts such as:

Savings Account
Current Account
Salary Account
Fixed Deposit Account

Every account has some common properties and operations, but each account follows different withdrawal rules.

Design the system using Object-Oriented Programming principles.


